#required NFS-VltEd version
version 4.5
#target game
game C
#mod description
ui_text Need For Speed Carbon - Better Light Flares
ui_text Version: 1.0.0
ui_text Author: Avalanche
ui_text 
ui_text Hi there, thanks for installing my mod!
ui_text This mod aims to improve Carbon's graphics by touching up the look of the light flashes and flares frequently seen in-game.
ui_text The goal was to create a more refined and vibrant look that still fits the game's atmosphere.
ui_text The color contrast of police lights, headlights, and taillights have been increased, as well as the size and style of some of these effects.
ui_text Also included is the option to disable white police lights, as seen in the console releases of the game.
ui_text This mod is certified to be fully compatible with all other graphical effects and mods, provided it is installed after them.
ui_text Feel free to make any changes you desire, and if any issues arise, please contact me!
ui_text 
#checkbox
ui_control checkbox option1_checkbox false "EXTRA FEATURE: Disable white police lights (similar to console versions)."
#images
ui_image LookAtMe.jpg



